{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51493","headline":"骊山怀古（五首） 五 · 李郢","name":"骊山怀古（五首） 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"当时事事笑秦皇，今日追思倍可伤。\n珠玉影摇千树冷，绮罗风动满川香。\n虽名金殿长生字，误说茅山不死方。\n独向逝波无问处，古槐花落路茫茫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51493.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51493","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}